new file mode 100644
index 0000000..76a74d5
--- /dev/null
+++ b/UTILIBRE-SOURCE.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,16 @@
+Rimgo on Utilibre
+Upstream: https://codeberg.org/rimgo/rimgo
+Revision: d2be8e221522dfe7a06452e2002dcf6dad569d1a
+License: AGPL-3.0; original notices retained.
+
+Utilibre changes: fixed HTTPS-only Imgur destinations with public DNS/IP pinning,
+redirect validation, bounded connections/time/body sizes, credential stripping,
+bounded parsed-result caches, sequential parsing to avoid concurrent slice writes,
+closed response bodies, media type/size restrictions, and deployed-source link.
+Build dependencies refreshed with the accompanying lockfile. No upload support,
+visitor account system, personal upstream credentials or challenge solver added.
+
+Build: docker build -f Dockerfile.utilibre -t utilibre-rimgo:d2be8e2-p1 .
+Use deployment/compose.rimgo.yaml with its gateway and firewall rules. Application
+and gateway logs are disabled; edge/Cloudflare processing and logging are disclosed
+in the native privacy configuration. Temporary content caches remain in memory.
